    {
      "stepId": "submission-confirmation",
      "title": "Application submitted",
      "behaviours": [],
      "markdownContent": "We have received your application for a swimming pool licence.\n\nA copy of your application has been sent to the email address you gave and to the Environmental Health Department at **{polyclinic}**.\n\nKeep your reference number in case you need to contact Environmental Health about your application.\n\n## What happens next\n\n- Environmental Health will review your application.\n- An officer will inspect the pool, the area around it and the safety equipment.\n- If your application is approved, Environmental Health will email you. Your licence will be posted to you, or you can collect it from the polyclinic.\n\nSubmitting an application does not mean that the licence has been granted.\n\n## Get help\n\nContact the Environmental Health Service office for your area.\n\n{polyclinicContact}",
      "elements": []
    }
